{
  "job_B9.7.4_20251003_115119": {
    "chunk_text": "Ac \u00feeos oncnawednysse \u00fe\u00e6re godcundnysse, & \u00fe\u00e6re so\u00f0f\u00e6stnysse wisedom is to leornigen So\u00f0lice se by\u00f0 ges\u00e6lig, \u00fee on riht leofe\u00f0, & wel libbende \u00feone fulfremede geleafe healde\u00f0. Witodlice se geleafe by\u00f0 unnytt buten \u00fean gode weorcan, swa eac \u00fea gode weorc bute \u00fean rihten Beo \u00fean Jacobus se apostol cw\u00e6\u00f0, hw\u00e6t help\u00f0, bro\u00f0re mine, \u00fe\u00e6t hwa secge, \u00fe\u00e6t he geleafe habbe, Wene\u00f0 he, m\u00e6ig hine seo geleafe gehealden? So\u00f0lice se geleafe bute gode weorcan, he by\u00f0 deaden gelic, & se lichame by\u00f0 dead buten \u00fean gaste. Beo \u00fe\u00e6s geleafen hehnysse us is eft to specane, for \u00fean \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t gewrit, \u00fee \u00feu \u00fee b\u00e6de awriten beo De caritate.",
